  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_036) achieve high accuracy (0.715). This experiment tests whether the image encoder's contribution is critical by comparing a rna_only model with the same scvi_n200 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation (used in config_036). It isolates the effect of the image encoder while keeping other design choices consistent, helping determine if multimodal approaches are necessary. This balances exploitation of promising RNA encoders with exploration of image data's value."
}

